    "displayName": "RESOURCE DRIVE: RECOVER SMALL SHIPMENT",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "El here.\n\nBit worried about one of our contractors who’s been ghosting me and hasn’t completed their delivery of resources for the UEE initiative.\n\nI need someone to head out to [Location] where they were last seen and bring back that cargo for us.\n\nIt was only between 50-55 SCU of various box sizes, so it shouldn’t be too hard for you to move them if you have a tractor beam, but that doesn’t mean you should take this job lightly. I’m a little worried there’s a reason our pilot isn’t responding. Be sure to keep an eye out for any hostiles in the area.\n\nGet the cargo to a freight elevator at: [Destination]. I’ll ensure it gets to the right place.\n\nActually, if you have another pilot with you, you might find it simpler to have one of you fly the cargo ship instead. Your call though.\n\nThanks for the assist,\n\nElla Tieno\nContractor Liaison Officer\nArcCorp",
